---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base";

const meta = {
	title: "Colophon",
	description: "How this site is built, and why it looks the way it does.",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<h1 class="mb-6 font-bold uppercase">Colophon</h1>
	<div class="flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
		<section class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
			<h2 class="font-bold">// the site</h2>
			<p>
				This is my corner of the internet, hand-built and maintained since May
				2022. Every line of markup, style, and script in it is something I can
				point at and explain — which is the whole point. It has been rebuilt a
				few times as tools changed, but it has always been mine.
			</p>
		</section>
		<section class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
			<h2 class="font-bold">// the stack</h2>
			<p>
				Pages are written in markdown and compiled to plain static HTML with
				<a
					class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
					href="https://astro.build">Astro</a
				>. Styling is
				<a
					class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
					href="https://tailwindcss.com">Tailwind CSS</a
				>, code blocks are highlighted at build time by
				<a
					class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
					href="https://shiki.style">Shiki</a
				>, and the whole thing is served from
				<a
					class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
					href="https://vercel.com">Vercel</a
				>. The source is on
				<a
					class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
					href="https://github.com/RatulMaharaj/ratulmaharaj.com">GitHub</a
				> — the commit this build came from is stamped in the footer.
			</p>
		</section>
		<section class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
			<h2 class="font-bold">// the type</h2>
			<p>
				Everything is set in
				<a
					class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
					href="https://monaspace.githubnext.com">Monaspace</a
				>: Argon for text, Krypton for code. Yes, the body text is a monospace
				font. It's a developer's blog — it should read like one.
			</p>
		</section>
		<section class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
			<h2 class="font-bold">// the rules</h2>
			<ul class="flex list-inside list-disc flex-col gap-y-1">
				<li>URLs never change. A link to this site keeps working.</li>
				<li>
					The <a
						class="text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
						href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a
					> carries full posts, not teasers.
				</li>
				<li>No paywalls, no popups, no newsletters interrupting you.</li>
				<li>Static HTML. View source — it's readable.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
